Rule 5 (combined rule to ensure x1 and x2 have same type and are floats.)
{x1 : tensor, x2 : tensor} |= (dtype_(x1) = dtype_(x2)) ∧ (dtype_(x1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(x1) = 8)
