Rule 11 (x1 and x2 must have compatible dtypes and shapes)
{x1 : tensor, x2 : tensor} |= (shape(x1) = shape(x2)) ∧ (dtype_(x1) = dtype_(x2))
>>
Rule 13 (x1 and x2 must be tensors, and their dtypes must be float32 or float64 and equal)
{x1 : tensor, x2 : tensor} |= (dtype_(x1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(x1) = 8) ∧ (dtype_(x2) = dtype_(x1))
>>
Rule 14 (x1 and x2 must have compatible dtypes and shapes, and x1 must be float32 or float64)
{x1 : tensor, x2 : tensor} |= (shape(x1) = shape(x2)) ∧ (dtype_(x1) = dtype_(x2)) ∧ (dtype_(x1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(x1) = 8)
>>
Rule 15 (If x1 is float32, then x2 must also be float32. If x1 is float64, then x2 must also be float64.)
{x1 : tensor, x2 : tensor} |= if dtype_(x1) = 7 then dtype_(x2) = 7 else if dtype_(x1) = 8 then dtype_(x2) = 8 else false
>>
Rule 20 (x1 and x2 should be either both float32 or both float64)
{x1 : tensor, x2 : tensor} |= (dtype_(x1) = 7 ∧ dtype_(x2) = 7) ∨ (dtype_(x1) = 8 ∧ dtype_(x2) = 8)
